WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.504
Megan was brushing her teeth.

2
00:00:06.505 --> 00:00:10.719
She left the water running.

3
00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:13.449
Sam banged on the door.

4
00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:16.390
"It's Earth Day!" he said.

5
00:00:16.391 --> 00:00:23.795
"Don't waste water!"

6
00:00:23.796 --> 00:00:27.105
Downstairs Dad collected bottles.

7
00:00:27.106 --> 00:00:29.219
Mom collected paper.

8
00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:35.974
"Recycling is good for the earth," said Dad.

9
00:00:35.975 --> 00:00:43.349
After breakfast Megan gathered food scraps.

10
00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:47.101
She and Dad took them outside to the compost.

11
00:00:47.102 --> 00:00:52.123
"Compost is good for the garden," said Dad.

12
00:00:52.124 --> 00:00:56.062
Megan saw a strange box in the yard.

13
00:00:56.063 --> 00:00:59.162
"What's that box?" asked Megan.

14
00:00:59.163 --> 00:01:03.158
"You'll see later," said Dad with a wink.

15
00:01:03.159 --> 00:01:05.404
Mom and Sam came outside.

16
00:01:05.405 --> 00:01:08.764
"Let's go grocery shopping," said Mom.

17
00:01:08.765 --> 00:01:11.188
"Okay," Megan said.

18
00:01:11.189 --> 00:01:14.618
"I'll get lunch ready here," said Dad.

19
00:01:14.619 --> 00:01:17.239
Megan stepped toward the car.

20
00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:19.801
"Let's walk," said Mom.

21
00:01:19.802 --> 00:01:27.919
"It's better for the environment."

22
00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:31.584
At the store a clerk got some plastic bags.

23
00:01:31.585 --> 00:01:35.985
"No thanks. We brought canvas shopping bags," said Mom.

24
00:01:35.986 --> 00:01:41.313
"They are better for the earth."

25
00:01:41.314 --> 00:01:48.886
Everyone was hungry after the long walk home.

26
00:01:48.887 --> 00:01:52.957
"I smell pizza!" said Megan.

27
00:01:52.958 --> 00:01:56.258
"Remember the box?" said Dad.

28
00:01:56.259 --> 00:02:00.847
"It's a solar oven!"

29
00:02:00.848 --> 00:02:08.711
"Awesome! The sun cooked the pizza," said Megan.

30
00:02:08.712 --> 00:02:14.637
"I love Earth Day!"

